# tmp/

Temporary files generated per run. Contents reset between runs.

## Subdirectories

generated/  - Generated .svh headers, .yaml configs
tcl/        - Generated + copied TCL files for Vivado
backup/     - Backups of files before build
sync/       - Benchmark-FI sync files

## Lifecycle

Created: Start of generation phase
Populated: Generation, file movement, build phases
Cleaned: End of run (configurable)